=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span><p class=\"bd-lede bd-pagehead__lede\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Floor-to-ceiling windows, vintage stained glass, an original Carrara marble floor, three 19th-century fireplaces, and 167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments.</span></p></div></header><section id=\"look\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"look-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Look for this\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"look-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Look for this</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><ol class=\"bd-docent\" aria-label=\"Look for this\"><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">01</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Count the illuminated ceiling embellishments: the venue says 167 were restored.</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">02</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">The floor is original Carrara marble.</span></span></li><li class=\"bd-docent__item\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"bd-docent__num\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">03</span></span><span class=\"bd-docent__text\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Three fireplaces date from the 19th century.</span></span></li></ol></div></section><section id=\"features\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--sheet\" aria-labelledby=\"features-title\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"What is in the room\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"features-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">What is in the room</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-prose\"><ul class=\"bd-list\"><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">floor-to-ceiling windows</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">vintage stained glass</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">original Carrara marble floor</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">three 19th-century fireplaces</span></li><li><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">167 restored illuminated ceiling embellishments</span></li></ul></div></div></section><section id=\"capacity\" class=\"bd-section bd-section--paper\" aria-labelledby=\"capacity-title\" data-bl-k=\"section\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity, in the venue’s own figures\"><div class=\"bd-section__inner\"><div class=\"bd-head\"><h2 id=\"capacity-title\" class=\"bd-h bd-h--2\"><span data-bl-t=\"heading\">Capacity, in the venue’s own figures</span></h2><span class=\"bd-head__rule\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-bl-s=\"\"></span></div><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Every room on these pages is one the venue offers for weddings.</span></p><div class=\"placeholder\" data-placeholder=\"true\" role=\"note\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span class=\"placeholder__label\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Sara + Tyler are still writing this:</span></span> <p class=\"placeholder__hint\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">which room hosts the ceremony, the cocktail hour, and the reception is not confirmed.</span></p></div></div><div class=\"bd-scroll\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Capacity figures\" tabindex=\"0\" data-bl-k=\"region\" data-bl-label=\"Capacity figures\"><table class=\"bd-table\"><caption class=\"bd-table__caption\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">These are the venue’s own figures for each room; Sara and Tyler have not confirmed them yet.</span></caption><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Ceremony</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Dinner and dancing</span></th><th scope=\"col\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Reception</span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">220</span></td><td data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">220</span></td><td data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">300</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"bd-prov\"><p class=\"prov\"><span class=\"prov__freshness\" data-freshness=\"fresh\"><span class=\"prov__badge prov__badge--ok\" data-bl-b=\"\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Checked</span><!-- --> <time datetime=\"2026-09-04T00:00:00.000Z\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">September 3, 2026</span></time></span></span></p></div><div class=\"bd-prose\"><p class=\"bd-back\"><a class=\"bd-link\" href=\"/our-venue\"><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">← </span><!-- --><span data-bl-t=\"copy\">Back to our venue</span></a></p></div></div></section></main><nav class=\"bd-bar\" aria-label=\"Quick actions\" style=\"--cells:3\" data-bl-s=\"\" data-bl-b=\"\" data-bl-k=\"nav\" data-bl-label=\"Quick actions\"><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/guests\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v14H4zM4 10h16M8 3v4M16 3v4\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Home</span></span></a><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/guests/travel\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M5 8h14v12H5zM9 8V5h6v3M9 8v12M15 8v12\"></path></svg><span><span data-bl-t=\"label\">Travel</span></span></a><a class=\"bd-bar__cell\" href=\"/guests/things-to-do\" data-bl-b=\"\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\" data-bl-m=\"icon\"><path d=\"M6 19a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0